Requires Vengeance
Your Vengeance talent can stack up an additional time.
@ext:Vengeance: Gives you a 3% bonus to Physical and Holy damage you deal for 30 sec after dealing a critical strike from a weapon swing, spell, or ability.  This effect stacks up to 3 times.:ext@

Requires Beacon of Light
Casting Holy Light on the target of your Beacon of Light extends the duration of Beacon of Light by 10 seconds and forms a bond that transfers 5% of damage they take to you for 10 sec.

@ext:You can only form bonds with players. The shared damage can not break crowd control effects.:ext@

Teaches you: Guardian of Ancient Kings. 
Guardian of Ancient Kings: Transform into a Guardian of Ancient Kings, resetting the cooldown of Hammer of the Righteous and Divine Storm. While active their cooldowns are reduced by 50%. Also increases your damage done by 15% and reduces damage taken by 10%. Lasts 10 sec.

@ext:Can not be active at the same time as Avenging Wrath.:ext@

Crusader Strike, Divine Storm and Holy Shock grant you Holy Power, which stacks up to 5 times.

You can consume 3 Holy Power to use Templar's Verdict or Word of Glory.

